# The scripts and Dockerfiles at the repository root and under eng/ are generated by
# `Build.ps1 generate-scripts`. Their content comes from C# raw string literals, whose newlines the compiler
# normalizes to LF, so a machine with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise rewrite the whole file every time it
# regenerates them. Pin them to LF to keep the diffs to the lines that actually changed.
#
# This never affects a Docker image tag: Get-ContentHash strips CR before hashing, so the same Dockerfile
# yields the same tag whichever way it was checked out.
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf
DockerBuild.ps1 text eol=lf
Build.ps1 text eol=lf
eng/RunClaude.ps1 text eol=lf
